    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Snakes and Ladders is a visually enhanced digital version of the classic board game, set in a dynamic 3D environment. Players move across a 3D board filled with animated snakes and ladders. The game supports a single-player mode where the player competes against multiple AI opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Single Player: Play against 1\u20133 AI-controlled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-AI Opponents: Multiple AI difficulty levels for varied challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-6 Different characters available for the player in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Animated Snakes: Snakes slither and animate when a player lands on them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Climbable Ladders: Characters visually climb ladders in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-3D Environment: Fully rendered board with zoom, rotate, and pan camera controls. 12 different challenges available for the player. Difficulty increases after each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Many More.</p>",
